1️⃣6️⃣ Fast Calculation Tricks

10%

Move decimal one place left.

\[
10\%\ of\ 450=45
\]

5%

Half of 10%.

\[
5\%\ of\ 450=22.5
\]

20%

Double 10%.

\[
20\%\ of\ 450=90
\]

25%

Divide by 4.

\[
25\%\ of\ 800=200
\]

50%

Divide by 2.

\[
50\%\ of\ 800=400
\]

75%

Three-fourths.

\[
75\%\ of\ 800=600
\]


